{
	"version": 5,
	"id": "B6_W7ZjH5Ei4JS-9M",
	"notes": "A Sanctioned Astra Militarum Primaris Psyker: Delta-grade on the Adeptus Astra Telepathica's Assignment scale (Psyker Talent 3), issued a force staff and trained in Pyromancy as a battlefield specialty. Built on the Thaumatology: Sorcery model (see framework.md and Imperium/Traits/Psykers and the Warp.adq): Psyker (Talent, the Sorcery Talent analogue) sharpens skills, while Warp Empowerment (Sorcerous Empowerment analogue) gates which powers can be known. This loadout's costliest known power is Molten Beam (full modified cost 9), so it only needs Warp Empowerment level 1 (cap 20, points 20) — well under Delta's theoretical ceiling of level 3 (cap 40); a GM growing this psyker into costlier Pyromancy or a different discipline should raise Warp Empowerment's level (and points) to match whatever they buy next, up to Delta's cap.\nPoint math: 80 (attributes: DX 20 + IQ 40 + HT 10 + Will 10) + 10 (Unusual Background) + 30 (Psyker 3) + 20 (Warp Empowerment 1) - 15 (Sanctioned Psyker) + 8 (Witch-sight, 10 base x 0.8 Warp Sorcery) + 21 (Pyromancy discipline at each power's default starting level: Fire Bolt 4 + Inferno/ Molten Beam alt 9+2 + Flame Breath 6) + 15 (skills) = 169 points, between framework.md's \"Trained soldier\" and \"Elite human\" tiers — well above a plain Guardsman, matching how rare and valuable a Sanctioned Psyker is to a regiment, and comfortably inside the 150-250 range expected of a Guard Primaris psyker. For a weaker Wyrdvane conscript-psyker (Epsilon grade), drop Psyker to level 2 and Warp Empowerment stays at level 1 (Epsilon's cap of 30 isn't needed by this discipline either), remove the discipline's higher-level purchases (keep each power at its base/level-1 cost), and add a Reputation or Social Stigma reflecting how nervously line troopers treat them. Swap the Pyromancy include for any other discipline in Imperium/ Traits/Psykers and the Warp.adq for a different specialty — remember to re-check Warp Empowerment's level against the new discipline's costliest power.\n",
