					"id": "tk-PL4uEr-5rfv0T8",
					"name": "Fire Bolt",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A thrown bolt of raw fire, the pyromancer's most basic attack.\n\nDesign: Innate Attack (Burning, 5/die, B61) with Warp Sorcery/Perils, net -30%. Full modified cost: 5 x 0.7 = ~4 points/level; needs Warp Empowerment level 1 (cap 20).",
