			"id": "ejMJP2wi8GH75XMVG",
			"description": "Force Staff",
			"local_notes": "Human-scale pattern, for Inquisitors and Astra Telepathica psykers; see the Astartes pattern below.\n\nLore: Many psykers prefer a staff to a blade: easier to carry openly as a badge of office, and a familiar focus for channelling telekinetic and biomantic workings. Common across Dark Heresy/Rogue Trader's force-weapon options and depicted for Inquisitorial and Adeptus Astra Telepathica psykers throughout Black Library.\n\nDesign: The mundane Power Stave's exact profile (melee.yaml): field off is a hardwood-and-metal quarterstaff (sw+2 cr / thr+2 cr), field on adds +3d and armour divisor (10) per the power-field rule, giving sw+3d+2(10) cr and thr+3d+2(10) cr, with the same charged Force Strike option and scaling note as the Force Sword. Handling: 5 lb and min ST 10 match the Power Stave. Staff keeps its parry 0 with no U, the same convention as the Power Stave and Shock Staff in melee.yaml; the skill's own defensive bonus is what a quarterstaff trades raw damage for.",
